# Hello, `.lnd`
The smallest useful document: a title, one claim with its source, and a note. Open it in the renderer and switch between Web, Slides and Source.

// profile: lnd-1.1 · scope: example · suggested_views: web, source

---

@heading h-1
text: A claim with a source
level: 1
@@

@claim a-boiling
text: At sea level, pure water boils at 100 °C.
certainty: Verified
source: f-textbook
@@

@source f-textbook
title: Any introductory chemistry textbook
type: referencia
@@

@note n-1
type: consejo

Change `certeza` to `Supuesto` and look at the block again: the renderer shows the difference.
@@
